#. module: fetchmail_attach_from_folder
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:fetchmail_attach_from_folder.field_fetchmail_server_folder__fetch_last_day_only
msgid ""
"By default, all emails in the folder are searched. Enable this option to "
"only fetch emails received in the last 24 hours. This helps avoid "
"reprocessing emails if they are not deleted after processing."
msgstr ""
"Privzeto se preiščejo vsa e-poštna sporočila v mapi. Omogočite to možnost za "
"pridobivanje le sporočil, prejetih v zadnjih 24 urah. Tako preprečite "
"ponovno obdelavo sporočil, ki po obdelavi niso izbrisana."

#. module: fetchmail_attach_from_folder
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:fetchmail_attach_from_folder.field_fetchmail_server_folder__fetch_unseen_only
